  "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"328\" src=\"/legacy/img/7e164a3df5-110.png\" width=\"1000\"></p>\n<h2><strong>📣EMRD碩士在職專班，110年招生即將開跑囉📣</strong><br> 跨領域課程，堅強師資合授，培育研發管理人才，連結產業跨界進化！<br> 一年僅一次招生，加入EMRD，一起迎戰精彩未來🌈<br> <em>今年度因應疫情，不舉辦實體招生說明會，相關招生資訊請關注網站<u><a href=\"/admissions/info\">招生資訊</a></u>或<u><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/EMRDofNTUST/\" title=\"EMRD FB\">FB粉專</a></u>資訊。</em></h2>\n<p>🎯報名時間&amp;系統：<strong>109.12.04 ~ 12.18</strong>&nbsp;(請至<u><a href=\"http://www.ntust.edu.tw/110entry2/\" title=\"報名系統\"><strong>網路報名</strong></a></u>，逾期不受理)<br> 🎯報名簡章：110年簡章&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.admission.ntust.edu.tw/var/file/52/1052/img/2675/667126014.pdf\" title=\"報名簡章\">https://bit.ly/362DvTf </a></u><br> 🎯考生報名表:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F2GDS9qV%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR1_fl0D7Cn5YhdMES-v5BZkz6gRVo6vXbsivxLDIVOuJlcshc9Xve53Agc&amp;h=AT1ZSgplNUwTv1KK4ClWti18jYkeaWduJZsWvchKVPgikCF-CU0l9unC0wD0G7msKxLerCxRfwoAJlc0PpcmmEVzADilvdLmhz6AgpSeNTBh-aPXKAyq4WXiJBQfenmnx49BlmxBf1rrP4MW7uKfeeWE4WiALc-LQCZiMwEik3Bzbrh_do8fX3BnN8Zg30y6lHU7vS8e_pPSVIeYZOW4LfxGGbvsppBmFM2RKBjMRB_ydHt24mjc3gM-elb0Yc98qk_oDntbhhrgCScX7bzOy_hNDnp_K1ACbWyZ0w5fB5Bld_I0-nK4DcqK5X8sO8LWkIpq4fQIhYk-q4zpdOpBlaeieA2V7T_LnsYSTHJHvVvBSlOuaFqv0wqQiqkwe5smJjmoRGuWzvqSJP1GJfJjgjQNWajdzz-Bh7aYfSWiWr5KalGaFFRbKgYmdN5xB5i1sbwr44UpVDQtT-45bNTb2y64MvzJ6I1motZIcfEB4xfDcHxurOapeIkZ85GKOSsoGFIJj0npMs7A4H8LKmfGiq3tHVGXoFAPkqFVSENRCMea7lyDh0K0VN0lkkwS1ClFQH7K9vDKH3nkV0robO_-sjYqKmsWYYNZo6bU4dMeg5rTFY7tCdtFLHaKAZP48MS5JlT8\">https://bit.ly/2GDS9qV</a>&nbsp;(可先下載填寫，報名時於系統上傳)<br> 🎯招生常見Q&amp;A:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F2HY0PsM%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR0AVzT3HZuDbvesobQ6In8dv8OeB5v-ao4SnX2HYYbD9YbY-v9X4YEUHoE&amp;h=AT0HfS90ZSbsSSraN_QQFwm6W-3Y9U-vTN6-h1de4MhLekgCg9xD_Ch1Xx2Pu5EQUtSqE4p2MrEDZWXsNkL7kcK1PV_gZE6YQts2P9VOnv2Nfvxes-cTObozrCuWUJHGcm36W4QSJVqE-ePcFes4M4ZJPqMrTFGl8y9GlXzkiE2pzZz0-BnMN1ynZvORlJGOz1J0OU8DaSXXMeprJFEvFaDg_55cASkSlbsL0dpRYH86Sjs_c73Bo_